[size=5][b]⚔ For modders[/b][/size]

Your own weapons can work the way katars and knuckledusters do - or be a different kind of hybrid: a mace that trains Blunt Weapon and Destruction, a spear only as good as the weaker of Spear and Conjuration. No scripting needed, one small definition file per weapon. All of it is documented in the [url=https://github.com/MaxYari/Katars-KnucklesOpenMW#-for-modders]git repository[/url], along with the mod's source and the tools that build it. If you are already reading this on git - just read below.
